uemacs (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * μEmacs v1.0 Production Release
  * Vim/Evil mode with full modal editing support
  * Built-in terminal emulator with VT500 emulation
  * Polyglot extension system (C, Zig, Go, Rust, Crystal, Fortran, Ada, Haskell, Pascal)
  * TOML configuration with XDG Base Directory support
  * TrueColor display with cursor-line highlighting
  * CI/CD pipeline with multi-distro testing
  * REPL integration for 25+ languages
  * Build system detection and error parsing
  * AI agent orchestration via NEUROXUS
  * Complete C23 modernization from original codebase

 -- μEmacs Team <maintainer@example.com>  Thu, 02 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000
